#   hydroclimatic manuscript without re-estimating the upstream scientific
#   analyses. This is a reporting layer over authoritative outputs from
#   Scripts 4, 7, 9, 12, 13, 15, and 16.
#
# PRIMARY OUTPUTS
#   manuscript_reporting/
#     Manuscript_numeric_results.csv
#     Manuscript_numeric_results.txt
