#     Table_MS_basin_trends_reporting.csv
#
# INTERPRETATION
#   No PET-source difference is decomposed physically. PET-PM versus
#   PET-ERA5 remains a product/formulation sensitivity diagnostic.
#   Shapley values are model-output allocations within FAO-56 PM only.
